
AtonixCorp DevSecOps Platform

Document purpose. This defines the complete AtonixCorp DevSecOps

experience from Run Pipeline through Settings. It gives product engineers, frontend developers, backend engineers, platform teams, security engineers, QA, SRE, and designers one implementation reference for navigation, workflows, data contracts, states, permissions, observability, and acceptance criteria.
